IMAPAccount posteo
Host posteo.de
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
UserCmd "$HOME/.dotfiles/scripts/mail-user"
PassCmd "$HOME/.dotfiles/scripts/mail-pass"
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/cert.pem

IMAPStore posteo-remote
Account posteo

MaildirStore posteo-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel posteo
Far :posteo-remote:
Near :posteo-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

# vim: set filetype=conf:
